# QDQC · Asset Usage

## Source of truth

- Raw archive: `assert/image/*.png`, `assert/zip/*.zip`, `assert/music/` — **read-only**, never edit / delete.
- **Permanent app assets** (committed): `web/public/media/{slices,parts,crops,image}` and `web/public/audio/`.
- Registry: `web/src/data/assets.ts` maps id → path → chapter → role.
- Policy: `web/ASSETS.md`.

## Sync (`npm run sync:assets`)

Only copies raw sheets + music from `assert/` → `public/media/image` and `public/audio` when newer.
**Never** regenerates or overwrites polished `slices/` / `parts/` / `crops/`.
Do **not** reintroduce batch image-processing scripts.

## Polished layout

| Path | Contents |
| --- | --- |
| `media/slices/{id}/` | Per-tile zip cuts (logos keyed; scene boards edge-trimmed) |
| `media/parts/` | Transparent subjects, flight frames, UI buttons (connectivity) |
| `media/crops/` | Chapter still aliases + NFC / poster / hero |
| `media/image/` | Full source sheets (reference) |

## Image map

| Source | Role |
| --- | --- |
| `001`–`002` zip | Logo / brand mark tiles → `slices/` + `brand.*` |
| `003`–`006` sheets | NFC card + posters → `crops/` |
| `007` `011` sheets | Desktop / ending heroes → `crops/` |
| `008` zip | Butterfly hero + poses + flight / elements → `parts/` |
| `009` zip | Magpie hero + poses + flight / elements → `parts/` |
| `010` zip | Magpie bridge + day variants + icons → `parts/` / `slices/` |
| `012`–`18` zip | Storyboard / chapter panels → `crops/` / `slices/` |
| `19`–`22` zip | UI kit → `parts/ui-btn-*`, `uiChrome.*` |

Prefer `crops.*`, `parts.*`, `uiButtons.*` over full sheets in UI / R3F.

## Framing (respect intrinsic size)

- Do **not** force art into fixed aspect boxes with `object-fit: contain` + dark letterbox bars.
- Prefer `FrameImage` / `width:100%; height:auto` so each file keeps its own ratio.
- Use `cover` only for intentional atmospheric full-bleed (e.g. journey sticky plate).
- Buttons: use committed `uiButtons` (background removed + connected components). Never CSS pills for story CTAs. Never straight-edge fractional crops of button silhouettes.

## When editing a single asset

1. Start from the matching file in `assert/zip` (or `assert/image` for NFC/poster).
2. Remove cream/white manual-cut fringe; for grouped UI, key navy then keep the connected component (incl. petals).
3. Overwrite the file under `public/media/...`; update `assets.ts` / `imageSize.ts` if paths or sizes change.

